{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-quasi-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8521c84a775897d68e64558f039f24c394cbfdb96ee47f278f289dc0c31eb20e", "source_text": "A base change of a quasi-projective morphism is quasi-projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3cd6d77da555825b5a178f5a76056fc9bdd58cad2fc6c110d84e3cfd0cb40f80", "unit_id": "tag:0B3G:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-finite-type}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-ample-base-change}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cd973d1e652775f23448adec07f1e3dc94288bd7d88d31b1e4cfed6d6f37f18a", "source_text": "This follows from\nLemmas <REF_0001> and\n<REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8699c3d14d0fda813fa4d162a3415ff7c08e2af910d8826e852afecfedb1063a", "unit_id": "tag:0B3G:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$g : Y \\to S$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$g$", "MATH_0006": "$g \\circ f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-quasi-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7f5719362501081abba8adf1d1230ac8ab6267d053f5f64e24c44590c804c71b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:011532607426b0b8b84eee643533e5ed078c97eddba9deb809fc04f900f0eb6b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be morphisms of schemes.\nIf <MATH_0003> is quasi-compact and <MATH_0004> and <MATH_0005> are quasi-projective,\nthen <MATH_0006> is quasi-projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:af65958ef1a7c86a97f7f617e5cbd154d8b481f960738610f6ab9dcb65dc62ca", "unit_id": "tag:0C4M:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-composition-finite-type}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-ample-composition}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b1d72940ecd92e74106139ce9951c6b3300d10a09b885bec7d6cdfc284028756", "source_text": "This follows from\nLemmas <REF_0001> and\n<REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8699c3d14d0fda813fa4d162a3415ff7c08e2af910d8826e852afecfedb1063a", "unit_id": "tag:0C4M:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-projective-properties}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:91f7f690005974538f9413d26e06567c7aaac53ad99387d497b14ae3e3c887e8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c314934f77c03d7fb200e58da98e492222fed740438f8bf828fd291df3a3635c", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes. If <MATH_0002> is quasi-projective,\nor H-quasi-projective or locally quasi-projective, then <MATH_0003> is\nseparated of finite type.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8e4bbde3a28740796393cf272656338c6ec0827582810cf5f8bb7174bab1ee1c", "unit_id": "tag:01VX:statement"}
