{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-H-quasi-projective-quasi-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:da528ad7d3d74e39100afeb91b0d0533993885f407397a82878bd56d5251f8a0", "source_text": "A H-quasi-projective morphism is quasi-projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5dcc275d4e3e7109eeb47836b00f1bc1d15ea92e14c0e07ad4cfe2745d4784e0", "unit_id": "tag:01VY:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:67dd53646b71c51a703e939415a690e35b1e4d69a26138380cb5222bdfcdf6cc", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:01VY:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$S = \\bigcup V_j$", "MATH_0004": "$f^{-1}(V_j) \\to V_j$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-characterize-locally-quasi-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5ba19a696eb8beeefa192dd9f89f42f4a6183d66b971c5e9ff2c1697e6ef678c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:444816557cec9f0092a1683890df31b00026358dff242c4368971b8ccb0f326b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nThe following are equivalent:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The morphism <MATH_0002> is locally quasi-projective.\n<STRUCT_0003> There exists an open covering <MATH_0003> such\nthat each <MATH_0004> is H-quasi-projective.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:293d77ea1e78e0b0727dd7daa7e989aef1e89bb288a66a3feb4cc335ccc3aa98", "unit_id": "tag:01VZ:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0006": "$X/S$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0008": "$X$", "MATH_0009": "$X$", "MATH_0010": "$S$", "MATH_0011": "$X$", "MATH_0012": "$S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-H-quasi-projective-quasi-projective}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-finite-type-over-affine-ample-very-ample}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-quasi-projective-finite-type-over-S}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:cf1f4203b927af303cf06b8653556a621efafe9a4251c194ad9c3cf1253baefb", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7c32c299f8a9c5160a69c3756429abd0cc5b5b60289d8b4a2b8eae135131caab", "source_text": "By Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe see that (2) implies (1). Assume (1).\nThe question is local on <MATH_0001> and hence we may assume <MATH_0002> is affine,\n<MATH_0003> of finite type over <MATH_0004> and\n<MATH_0005> is a relatively ample invertible sheaf on <MATH_0006>.\nBy Lemma <REF_0002>\nwe may assume <MATH_0007> is ample on <MATH_0008>.\nBy Lemma <REF_0003> we see that there\nexists an immersion of <MATH_0009> into\na projective space over <MATH_0010>, i.e., <MATH_0011> is H-quasi-projective over <MATH_0012>\nas desired.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b5b433906910a41c3eb5e4cf53feb6e8b9231221fe30be43ba13f05c87c3a9c0", "unit_id": "tag:01VZ:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{reference}\n\\cite[II, Proposition 5.3.4 (i)]{EGA}\n\\end{reference}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-affine-finite-type-quasi-projective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:63860f866ff9d8269a84563e07a9d80becac0a77c571c32d0d29e00342eec84e", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nA quasi-affine morphism of finite type is quasi-projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2aab70a8e2b46f7c751a82b737a908f913598ce82357858524abfa12d8363881", "unit_id": "tag:0B3H:statement"}
